        "created_at": "2015-01-05T15:56:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I ended a game with Warfang with Nightmist,<strong> \"The Reckless, Indiscriminate Champion Chaos Lord.\"&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Apparently the crowd loves repeated castings of Oblivion. Who knew? Faye was totally obnoxious about all the titles she accrued as she left the arena. Started demanding all her teammates call her that <em>all</em> the time now. Totally let it get to her head.</p><p>Joking aside, what heroes are you noticing are good at grabbing titles in the Kagaara Warfang fight? Nightmist with her shenanigans seems awfully good at nabbing them, but she's my main hero. I get the feeling that my other mains, like Mr. Fixer and Omni-X wouldn't have such an easy time.&nbsp;</p>",
