        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-05T17:48:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>KNYFE is the Queen of the arena. &nbsp;She can easily gain most titles, and Stonejaw is the only one she can't get on her own.</p><p>I once earned 5 titles in one turn with Knyfe.</p><p>Fanatic is my favorite arena champion (Living Weapon+The Seeker is INSANE!), but KNYFE might be the most Title grabbing Character.</p><p>Haka is just ridiculous though, I've gained 4 titles and 16 favor with a Rampage. &nbsp;The crowd loves it when Haka just runs in and starts punching all of the things.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
