        "raw": "<p>I played a game with Sky-Scraper where she ended up with five titles.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The game ended when The Unbreakable Mindbreaker Sky-Scraper the Indiscriminate Reckless Living Weapon turned into a Thorathian Monolith and and demolished pretty much everything in the arena, including herself and Warfang. When the dust settled, Guise and Legacy were both standing amid the rubble and the roaring crowd (I stopped counting the favor after it got over 28). Guise was known as Death-Caller the Chaos Lord and damned proud of it. Legacy however needed no title.</p>",
